Package: ouanalytics
Title: Calculations Behind the NBA Over/Under Pool Page
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chester", "Ismay", email = "chester.ismay@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The calculations that score the NBA over/under pool (each
    team's status against its win total, each player's points, the change
    since yesterday, wins still needed) and seed the playoffs with the
    official NBA tie-break procedure. Used by the page build in the parent
    folder. Not for CRAN.
